  "serviceTypes": [
    {
      "target": "$service",
      "metadata": {
        "label": "Service",
        "description": "The Solace service type attached to a `solace:Listener` for asynchronous (push-based) consumption.\n\nAn attached service must declare a remote `onMessage` method and may optionally declare an\n`onError` method. The accepted signatures are:\n```ballerina\nremote function onMessage(record {|*solace:Message; T payload;|} message) returns solace:Error?;\nremote function onMessage(record {|*solace:Message; T payload;|} message, solace:Caller caller) returns solace:Error?;\nremote function onMessage(solace:Message message) returns solace:Error?;\nremote function onError(solace:Error err) returns solace:Error?;\n```\nDeclaring a narrowed `payload` type (`T`) causes the message payload to be data-bound into that\ntype; declaring the base `solace:Message` type yields the raw payload as `anydata`.\nThe subscription (queue or topic) and flow options are supplied via the\n`@solace:ServiceConfig` annotation on the service."
      },
      "state": {
        "editable": false,
        "enabled": true
      },
      "handlers": [
        {
          "target": "$service.onMessage",
          "metadata": {
            "label": "onMessage",
            "description": "The `onMessage` remote method is triggered when a message is received from the subscribed Solace queue or topic."
          },
          "parameters": [
            {
              "target": "$service.onMessage.message",
              "metadata": {
                "label": "Message",
                "description": "The message received from the Solace queue or topic."
              },
              "fields": [
                {
                  "target": {
                    "kind": "recordField",
                    "owner": "message.parameter",
                    "path": "type"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "label": "Parameter Type",
                    "description": "The type of the parameter"
                  },
                  "state": {
                    "enabled": true,
                    "editable": true,
                    "optional": true,
                    "advanced": false
                  },
                  "key": "type",
                  "default": "",
                  "widget": {
                    "widgetKind": "DATA_BINDING",
                    "selected": true
                  },
                  "properties": {
                    "payload": {
                      "key": "payload",
                      "default": "",
                      "metadata": {
                        "label": "Message Configuration",
                        "description": "Define the shape of the Solace message payload."
                      },
                      "source": {
                        "construct": {
                          "kind": "PAYLOAD_TYPE_INCLUDED_RECORD"
                        },
                        "payload": {
                          "boundType": "",
                          "typeConstraint": "anydata",
                          "defaultType": "solace:Message",
                          "template": "{{type}}",
                          "modifiers": {
                            "type": "ballerinax/solace:1.0.0:Message",
                            "field": "payload",
                            "template": "{{type}}"
                          }
                        },
                        "bindable": true,
                        "bindingKind": "USER_SELECTED"
                      },
                      "state": {
                        "enabled": true,
                        "editable": true,
                        "optional": false,
                        "advanced": false
                      },
                      "widget": {
                        "widgetKind": "PAYLOAD_TYPE",
                        "selected": true,
                        "formats": [
                          {
                            "supported": [
                              "schema",
                              "browse",
                              "json",
                              "xml"
                            ],
                            "defaultFormat": "json"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "target": {
                    "kind": "recordField",
                    "owner": "message.parameter",
                    "path": "name"
                  },
